flowchart TD
  accTitle: From the server's markup to a live chart
  accDescr: On the server, the chart's config goes through renderForHydration(), which gives marked markup at the server's size. In the browser, the page shows that markup scaled to its container before any script runs. lineChart() with liveDomRenderer() then takes the markup over in a render with the cause hydrate, keeping the server's elements. When the container's size differs from the server's, a render with the cause resize lays the chart out at the container's size.

  subgraph server [On the server]
    config[The chart's config] --> markup["renderForHydration()"]:::code
  end

  markup -->|markup at the server's size| shown

  subgraph browser [In the browser]
    shown[The page shows the markup, scaled] --> chart["lineChart() with liveDomRenderer()"]:::code
    chart --> hydrate(["render: hydrate<br>keeps the server's elements"]):::accent
    hydrate -->|if the size differs| resize(["render: resize<br>at the container's size"])
  end
